<title>PHILIPPINES: Benguet 1st half net loss 73.1 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Benguet 1st half net loss 73.1 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating Revenues (billion)	    1.516 vs 1.542</p>
<p>    Net income				    (73.1) vs 31.1</p>
<p>Note: Full name Benguet Corp. Company said higher losses from its Antamok mines and its subsidiary operations accounted for the &quot;unfavourable variants&quot; in its bottom line earnings.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
